# Fill in the account name and password yourself (never copied). The response holds the session token.
@host = https://fm.example.com
@username = <account name>
@password = <password>

### Log in (create a session)
POST {{host}}/fmi/data/vLatest/databases/Sales%20DB/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{username}}:{{password}}

